-- The farmer's personal details on the Livestock record's first tab
-- (livestock_livestock_tab), between the farmer's ids and the survey personnel: gender, date of
-- birth, primary phone, marital status, education, language and disability.
--
-- farmer_reference/projection.py copies them from the approved Farmer into the
-- record's farmer_* columns when the record is written, and again onto every active
-- record of a Farmer when a change to that Farmer is approved here
-- (refresh_linked_records). A Farmer without a value never clears one. The section is
-- read-only: the farmer's details change in the Farmer Registry.
--
-- Idempotent: a section upsert and a tab-section upsert.

